 {
  "coord": "30:17",
  "verdict": "FAIL",
  "category": "omission",
  "note": "\"first\" dropped from \"the first to break the pleasant charm\".",
  "replacement": "The moments glided on. Good fellowship passed around the circle like a mystic cord, and held these people together with jest and laughter. Monsieur Ratignolle was the first to break the pleasant charm. He excused himself at ten o’clock, since Madame Ratignolle was waiting for him at home. She was bien souffrante and full of vague dread, and only her husband’s presence could calm it."
 },
